WEBVTT

01:26.825 --> 01:28.385
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.465 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.105 --> 01:36.345
Grand Tutor Ling forced me to choose.

01:36.425 --> 01:39.265
So, I want him to know
how hard that choice is.

01:41.425 --> 01:42.545
I'm innocent!

01:43.225 --> 01:45.825
Your Majesty, I'm truly innocent!

01:45.905 --> 01:47.985
I never forced Your Majesty!

01:48.625 --> 01:49.905
Father…

01:51.225 --> 01:52.465
Sir,

01:52.545 --> 01:55.225
I want to save the people of Jiangzhou
and the people of Xuzhou.

01:55.945 --> 01:57.905
Tell me, what should I do?

02:07.745 --> 02:09.584
If you're killing me, do it.
No need for all this chatter!

02:15.705 --> 02:17.905
-Loose the arrows!
-No!

02:22.305 --> 02:23.265
WINE

02:28.425 --> 02:30.865
No! Your Majesty…

02:32.065 --> 02:35.185
I'm begging you! Please let him go!

02:35.265 --> 02:36.705
It was my fault!

02:37.465 --> 02:39.265
Please, Your Majesty!

02:40.505 --> 02:42.025
Just let him go…

02:42.105 --> 02:44.105
I'm begging you…

02:44.705 --> 02:45.905
I was wrong…

02:50.065 --> 02:52.145
It's all my fault…

02:54.625 --> 02:56.545
Please…

03:00.225 --> 03:02.905
Sir, what do you say?

03:02.985 --> 03:06.385
I will do everything I can

03:06.465 --> 03:09.625
to get grain to Xuzhou and Jiangzhou.

03:10.305 --> 03:13.225
I was wrong! It's all my fault!

03:13.825 --> 03:15.745
Xiao Huan… Xiao Huan…

03:15.825 --> 03:17.945
spare him…

03:19.945 --> 03:23.865
Please spare him, I'm begging you…

03:31.905 --> 03:33.785
WINE

03:40.505 --> 03:42.985
Cangcang. Father.

03:46.425 --> 03:47.385
My death means nothing!

03:48.345 --> 03:49.185
I only hope

03:50.465 --> 03:51.585
you're never threatened again!

03:58.225 --> 03:59.505
Luo!

04:11.945 --> 04:12.865
No!

04:14.305 --> 04:15.585
Luo!

04:57.265 --> 04:58.585
Xianxue…

05:03.225 --> 05:04.185
Cangcang…

05:06.145 --> 05:07.465
I can't protect you anymore.

05:09.305 --> 05:10.465
You have to live well.

05:12.785 --> 05:14.225
You must keep on living!

06:19.865 --> 06:21.145
Still trying to run?

06:22.145 --> 06:23.065
Let me tell you:

06:23.585 --> 06:24.865
Even if you flee to the ends of the earth,

06:25.465 --> 06:28.185
with this Heartbane in you,
there's no escape!

06:28.865 --> 06:31.425
I… I won't dare again.

06:31.505 --> 06:33.185
Never again.

06:34.665 --> 06:37.785
You opened this Butterfly Lock?

06:39.985 --> 06:43.105
-Yes.
-Such a complicated Butterfly Lock,

06:43.185 --> 06:44.225
and you still managed to open it.

06:45.265 --> 06:46.905
Looks like you've got some skills.

06:47.505 --> 06:48.465
Come with me.

06:50.305 --> 06:53.065
I have a disciple named Cangcang.

06:53.145 --> 06:56.785
You'll stay by her side,
and be her friend.

06:58.065 --> 07:00.065
No matter what happens,

07:00.145 --> 07:01.905
you must protect her,

07:02.425 --> 07:03.665
even if it costs your life.

07:04.665 --> 07:06.945
Cangcang,
why don't we go back to Southern Chu

07:07.545 --> 07:08.705
and rebuild Fenglai Pavilion?

07:10.065 --> 07:12.585
Can I ever be
the Ling Cangcang I used to be?

07:17.425 --> 07:20.785
PURE AND SPOTLESS

07:24.105 --> 07:26.465
Greetings, Your Majesty.

07:27.105 --> 07:28.905
Grand Tutor Ling, you're in quite a hurry.

07:28.985 --> 07:30.545
Is there news of the grain?

07:30.625 --> 07:31.465
Your Majesty,

07:31.545 --> 07:35.345
I've contacted the grain merchants
in the Capital and all the prefectures.

07:35.425 --> 07:37.905
They've volunteered
300 thousand dan of grain.

07:38.705 --> 07:40.305
It'll all be delivered within a month.

07:43.105 --> 07:44.545
This is their joint petition.

07:59.825 --> 08:00.705
Eunuch Feng,

08:01.225 --> 08:03.585
show Grand Tutor Ling the plan
to send aid to Jiangzhou.

08:04.225 --> 08:05.105
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:08.665 --> 08:09.705
Your Majesty.

08:16.985 --> 08:17.825
What's the matter?

08:46.065 --> 08:47.305
We truly cannot go back?

08:47.825 --> 08:50.625
From the very beginning,
there was only deceit between us.

08:51.225 --> 08:52.145
My death means nothing!

08:53.265 --> 08:54.105
I only hope

08:54.745 --> 08:56.225
you're never threatened again!

09:04.305 --> 09:06.265
Why did you kill my master?

09:07.185 --> 09:09.465
Did you approach me

09:12.705 --> 09:14.705
just to kill my master?

09:15.305 --> 09:17.625
I know you misunderstood me before.

09:18.145 --> 09:21.185
Can you give me one more chance
so we can start over?

09:29.145 --> 09:30.785
You don't need to rush to answer me.

09:31.425 --> 09:33.505
I'll stay by your side

09:34.305 --> 09:36.465
until you willingly walk toward me.

09:40.105 --> 09:41.305
This is the palace,

09:41.385 --> 09:42.785
not the martial world.

09:43.705 --> 09:45.305
The palace is an arena of power,

09:45.825 --> 09:48.065
not a place
that cares about right or wrong.

09:49.185 --> 09:50.145
Ling Cangcang,

09:51.185 --> 09:52.505
you're still not ruthless enough.

10:00.785 --> 10:02.785
Cangcang, what are you doing?

10:14.345 --> 10:15.865
It's so quiet here.

10:18.305 --> 10:19.905
I'm just calming down here

10:21.785 --> 10:23.665
and thinking some things through.

10:26.105 --> 10:27.105
Think about what?

10:28.505 --> 10:29.545
First,

10:30.985 --> 10:32.425
you used me again,

10:33.505 --> 10:35.105
killing two birds with one stone.

10:40.225 --> 10:41.945
You forced my father to give in

10:43.585 --> 10:45.065
and got Luo killed.

10:47.025 --> 10:49.025
I never once thought of using you,

10:49.545 --> 10:52.265
and I never meant
to drive Luo Xianxue to his death.

10:52.345 --> 10:53.825
It doesn't matter anymore.

10:55.585 --> 10:57.105
He's gone for good, anyway.

11:00.585 --> 11:01.625
Second,

11:02.545 --> 11:05.465
I don't want to be empress
not even for one more day.

11:10.545 --> 11:12.385
This splendid capital

11:13.465 --> 11:15.985
is rotten with schemes and treachery.

11:17.105 --> 11:18.505
I used to think

11:19.025 --> 11:19.985
that staying in this palace,

11:20.065 --> 11:22.265
I could at least protect
the people I care about.

11:24.985 --> 11:26.065
I lost.

11:29.225 --> 11:30.345
And I'm tired.

11:38.865 --> 11:41.425
Tell me, if I really jump from here,

11:42.705 --> 11:44.225
will I finally be free?

11:49.985 --> 11:51.385
There's one more thing.

11:53.585 --> 11:54.785
Do you want to hear it?

11:56.625 --> 11:57.465
What?

12:06.105 --> 12:07.785
I hate myself
for judging people so poorly,

12:08.985 --> 12:10.385
for giving my heart to the wrong person.

12:12.065 --> 12:14.425
I deserve this heartbreak.

12:21.785 --> 12:22.625
Zhong Lin.

12:23.425 --> 12:24.545
Zhong Lin…

12:40.625 --> 12:41.665
What are you hiding?

12:42.185 --> 12:43.945
Nothing. I was just carving.

12:44.865 --> 12:47.305
Oh, right… I just went to see the Empress.

12:47.385 --> 12:49.745
-Do you know what she said to me?
-What did she say?

12:54.025 --> 12:55.145
You've got guts, Zhong Lin.

12:56.265 --> 12:58.505
Now you even dare forge the Imperial Seal!

13:01.825 --> 13:02.785
PALACE DEFENSE MAP

13:03.385 --> 13:04.945
A map of the palace defenses?

13:06.265 --> 13:08.905
Zhong Lin, are you insane?
Do you know what you're doing?

13:09.665 --> 13:10.665
Keep your voice down!

13:11.265 --> 13:12.265
Are you trying to get me killed?

13:13.665 --> 13:15.265
I'm getting you killed?

13:15.345 --> 13:17.145
Right in my manor,
you're making something like this.

13:17.225 --> 13:18.665
You're trying to get me killed!

13:19.265 --> 13:20.625
This is a capital crime
that wipes out your whole clan!

13:22.065 --> 13:23.265
I don't even have a clan.

13:23.985 --> 13:24.825
Besides,

13:25.945 --> 13:27.105
if you keep quiet, who'll ever know?

13:38.025 --> 13:39.345
Move. You're blocking my light.

13:41.425 --> 13:43.105
What exactly are you trying to do?

13:43.185 --> 13:44.625
I'm going to save Cangcang.

13:44.705 --> 13:46.945
Abducting the Empress
is a capital crime too.

13:47.025 --> 13:48.305
Trust you to come up with that!

13:49.065 --> 13:50.425
Cangcang sent me a message.

13:50.505 --> 13:51.545
She said
she doesn't want to stay in the palace.

13:52.625 --> 13:54.225
Anything Cangcang wants to do,

13:54.305 --> 13:55.945
I have to help her do it.

13:56.865 --> 13:58.945
Your plan definitely won't work.

13:59.825 --> 14:01.665
Then do you have a better one?

14:04.185 --> 14:06.105
I'm the Prince of Yuzhang.

14:06.825 --> 14:07.825
What's wrong with me taking someone out?

14:13.985 --> 14:15.065
So can you help me?

14:15.585 --> 14:17.465
As long as you help me, I can…

14:21.745 --> 14:23.545
You can… do what?

14:26.145 --> 14:27.945
I can help you take Xiao Huan's throne.

14:29.905 --> 14:32.145
I'll risk life and limb,
whatever it takes!

14:35.385 --> 14:37.385
You hate Xiao Huan that much?

14:39.705 --> 14:42.705
If he makes Cangcang sad,
then I'm not okay with it.

14:43.345 --> 14:45.705
Anyone Cangcang doesn't like,
I don't like either.

14:54.465 --> 14:56.225
So are you helping me or not?

15:04.465 --> 15:05.305
Depends on my mood.

15:10.465 --> 15:11.385
Depends on your mood?

15:12.545 --> 15:13.985
So that's a no!

15:16.065 --> 15:19.905
LINGHE HALL

15:33.745 --> 15:34.625
Your Majesty.

15:35.305 --> 15:36.865
This was sent over from Xuanguang Hall.

15:36.945 --> 15:39.025
It looks like wine mash,

15:39.105 --> 15:40.705
but why is it shaped so oddly?

15:51.025 --> 15:52.065
You may go.

15:52.665 --> 15:53.505
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:19.225 --> 16:20.865
TOKEN

16:33.265 --> 16:35.825
His Majesty arrives!

16:52.265 --> 16:53.465
Greetings, Your Majesty.

16:54.745 --> 16:55.745
Three days from now,

16:55.825 --> 16:57.705
the reinforcements will depart
for Jiangzhou

16:57.785 --> 16:58.905
to support General Ling.

17:02.945 --> 17:04.025
Thank you, Your Majesty.

17:10.665 --> 17:12.105
As for Luo Xianxue's death,

17:12.625 --> 17:15.345
I never expected he would do that.

17:16.625 --> 17:17.704
I understand.

17:18.305 --> 17:20.105
Your Majesty has your own burdens.

17:20.184 --> 17:21.025
You need not blame yourself.

17:27.025 --> 17:29.065
Cangcang,
you've gotten much thinner lately…

17:41.745 --> 17:42.585
Your Majesty,

17:44.025 --> 17:46.385
I heard when the reinforcements march out,

17:46.465 --> 17:48.905
Nanrong Palace will hold
a grand river-offering ceremony

17:48.985 --> 17:51.705
at the banks of the Qining River,
praying for the soldiers.

17:51.785 --> 17:52.825
Is that so?

17:53.585 --> 17:54.465
Yes.

17:55.185 --> 17:57.665
Would you care to attend with me?

18:00.905 --> 18:02.345
I was actually going to say

18:03.065 --> 18:04.225
I'm not fond of noisy occasions,

18:05.705 --> 18:06.705
so I won't go.

18:35.785 --> 18:38.145
His Majesty arrives!

18:41.545 --> 18:42.385
Greetings, Your Majesty.

18:47.665 --> 18:48.825
Carry on with your drills.

18:52.905 --> 18:55.145
How are preparations
for the ceremony coming along?

18:56.225 --> 18:58.585
Please rest assured. Everything is ready.

18:59.265 --> 19:01.785
As for the finale of the fireworks,

19:01.865 --> 19:04.625
would you prefer
a golden dragon in the sky, or…?

19:07.225 --> 19:08.305
A golden phoenix.

19:08.385 --> 19:11.185
Let the golden phoenix see them off
and bless their journey.

19:11.985 --> 19:13.465
The Empress doesn't even want to come.

19:14.425 --> 19:17.025
Does it really mean anything
to do all this?

19:20.585 --> 19:21.625
What if

19:22.305 --> 19:24.705
the Empress changes her mind?

19:39.665 --> 19:41.025
She doesn't have you in her heart.

19:41.745 --> 19:43.465
Why would she change her mind?

19:52.745 --> 19:55.265
Did you get the exit token I sent you?

20:01.305 --> 20:03.705
In two days,
it's the river-offering ceremony.

20:04.465 --> 20:06.585
With crowds going in and out
of the palace,

20:06.665 --> 20:09.865
that token will let you leave.

20:11.065 --> 20:12.385
Why are you helping me?

20:14.945 --> 20:16.065
I gave Zhong Lin my word.

20:17.785 --> 20:18.985
More than helping Zhong Lin,

20:19.745 --> 20:22.425
I'm afraid what you want most is to see
the Emperor and Empress fall out.

20:23.905 --> 20:24.785
You saw through all that?

20:26.145 --> 20:27.745
If you leave my brother,

20:27.825 --> 20:30.145
the Ling clan
won't be backing him as much.

20:30.905 --> 20:33.665
Then, I'll have my chance.

20:35.265 --> 20:36.625
Thank you for your kindness,

20:38.185 --> 20:39.025
but I have my own way.

20:41.545 --> 20:42.985
You really don't need my help?

20:44.105 --> 20:46.145
I'm usually cold and heartless.

20:46.225 --> 20:47.705
It's rare I offer to help.

20:48.345 --> 20:51.025
And you still don't appreciate it?

20:55.865 --> 20:57.745
I don't want Zhong Lin owing you a favor.

20:58.305 --> 21:00.785
There's one more thing
I'd like to ask of you.

21:01.865 --> 21:02.865
Go ahead.

21:04.505 --> 21:06.825
Please take good care of Zhong Lin.
Don't let her come looking for me.

21:07.665 --> 21:08.505
Where are you going?

21:10.025 --> 21:11.385
Better if you don't know.

21:24.705 --> 21:25.545
Ladies,

21:25.625 --> 21:27.985
this year's river-offering ceremony
is especially grand.

21:28.065 --> 21:30.745
I hear His Majesty
will personally see off the troops.

21:31.905 --> 21:32.905
I heard that too.

21:33.425 --> 21:35.265
To be chosen by Preceptor Du to dance

21:35.345 --> 21:37.425
-is such an honor.
-Yeah.

21:37.505 --> 21:40.185
After today's sword dance,
we get to escort the army out of the city.

21:40.265 --> 21:42.025
-How glorious is that!
-Yeah!

21:43.825 --> 21:44.665
Ladies!

21:45.425 --> 21:46.265
Ladies,

21:47.185 --> 21:48.905
the river-offering ceremony
is about to begin.

21:48.985 --> 21:50.145
Hurry and come with me.

21:50.225 --> 21:51.345
-Move it!
-Come on, quickly!

22:13.825 --> 22:15.705
QI

22:28.545 --> 22:30.305
Her Majesty still refuses to come.

22:43.065 --> 22:47.625
Our best wishes to His Majesty
and the Empress Dowager!

22:52.105 --> 22:52.945
Rise!

23:02.425 --> 23:04.025
The Empress still hasn't changed her mind.

23:05.305 --> 23:07.385
To skip such an important ceremony,

23:08.225 --> 23:09.705
seems she has no respect

23:10.305 --> 23:13.465
for our ancestral rites.

23:14.145 --> 23:15.785
The Empress cares deeply for Great Qi.

23:16.305 --> 23:17.305
Wherever she is,

23:17.385 --> 23:19.105
she'll be praying for our land.

23:22.065 --> 23:22.905
Let's begin!

23:24.465 --> 23:25.505
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:31.585 --> 23:35.665
The auspicious hour has come!

23:41.545 --> 23:42.745
We, the people of Great Qi,

23:42.825 --> 23:44.745
with heaven, earth, sun
and moon as our bounds,

23:44.825 --> 23:46.625
and nourished by the grace of our rivers,

23:47.225 --> 23:49.985
rise early and toil till night,
plowing fields and tending grain.

23:50.065 --> 23:53.225
We pray the River Deity to bless Great Qi,
let our lands be rich,

23:53.305 --> 23:56.425
our harvests be full,
winds and rains be gentle,

23:56.505 --> 23:57.825
and our years full of plenty.

24:01.905 --> 24:04.265
Offer incense!

24:22.145 --> 24:24.585
Offer the wine!

24:35.985 --> 24:38.545
Send the offerings!

24:42.465 --> 24:45.105
Sword dance to honor Heaven,
may our land stand strong!

26:00.985 --> 26:03.065
Today's sword dance was well done.

26:03.625 --> 26:04.465
All of you, step forward.

26:31.545 --> 26:33.665
I like your dance very much.

26:33.745 --> 26:36.665
Today, you'll join me for the banner rite.

26:36.745 --> 26:38.985
Your Majesty, this goes against ritual.

26:39.745 --> 26:40.585
In the Emperor's banner rite,

26:40.665 --> 26:42.105
how can a mere palace maid
stand beside you?

26:43.345 --> 26:45.705
I've already decided. No need to say more.

26:46.785 --> 26:47.625
I

26:48.825 --> 26:50.065
just want to stand with you.

27:08.265 --> 27:10.945
His Majesty shoots the banner
to honor the river!

27:46.945 --> 27:49.105
Today, I offer sacrifice to the deity

27:49.185 --> 27:51.305
to bless the soldiers of Great Qi.

27:51.385 --> 27:53.665
May you keep our land safe
and return in triumph!

27:53.745 --> 27:57.025
Return in triumph!

27:57.105 --> 28:01.265
Return in triumph!

28:07.225 --> 28:10.425
Did you plan to give me a surprise?

28:16.785 --> 28:17.625
Let me go.

28:26.865 --> 28:29.945
Is life by my side
really worse than death?

28:36.505 --> 28:37.385
It is.

28:46.945 --> 28:47.785
All right.

28:48.625 --> 28:49.465
You may go.

29:28.945 --> 29:30.265
I always thought

29:30.785 --> 29:32.985
Your Majesty would never
show your emotions.

29:33.945 --> 29:34.985
Turns out

29:35.505 --> 29:37.185
you just hadn't met
the one you cared about.

29:38.345 --> 29:40.545
That palace maid today was the Empress.

29:43.385 --> 29:46.825
Since you recognized her, why let her go?

29:50.465 --> 29:52.225
You've done so much for her,

29:53.305 --> 29:54.225
and she knows nothing.

29:55.545 --> 29:56.905
Letting her walk away like this,

29:57.745 --> 29:58.705
can you really accept that?

30:01.145 --> 30:02.465
What she wants is freedom.

30:03.145 --> 30:04.825
In your whole life,

30:04.905 --> 30:06.705
have you ever had
a single moment of freedom?

30:09.265 --> 30:10.745
I never had a choice.

30:11.585 --> 30:15.225
That's why
I don't want her to become another me.

30:48.225 --> 30:49.785
You want to go to Jiangzhou, don't you?

30:53.545 --> 30:54.505
You may go.

31:07.665 --> 31:09.825
From Phoenix Terrace I gaze at the sky.

31:10.785 --> 31:13.145
Only the golden phoenix
carries parting in its wings.

31:14.305 --> 31:18.185
Phoenix and fenghuang
were meant to fly together.

31:19.985 --> 31:21.665
If only the golden phoenix flies alone,

31:23.505 --> 31:26.025
isn't that the saddest farewell of all?

31:43.945 --> 31:46.745
LINGHE HALL

31:49.865 --> 31:52.305
FATE'S RISE AND FALL HEED NO ONE'S WILL

32:31.345 --> 32:33.145
FATE'S RISE AND FALL HEED NO ONE'S WILL

32:36.745 --> 32:37.825
Rise.

32:39.505 --> 32:40.425
From today on,

32:40.945 --> 32:42.665
the Empress will be said
to suffer from head pains

32:42.745 --> 32:44.025
and will recover in the outer palace.

32:44.545 --> 32:46.345
No one is allowed an audience.

33:37.945 --> 33:39.785
You truly love her that much?

33:50.985 --> 33:52.145
Ling Cangcang,

33:53.505 --> 33:55.225
you've hurt him this deeply.

33:56.705 --> 33:58.505
If you stir up trouble again,

33:59.345 --> 34:01.905
I will never let you live in peace!

34:21.545 --> 34:22.665
Your Majesty.

34:23.545 --> 34:25.905
Give this Phoenix Seal to Cangcang for me.

34:26.505 --> 34:28.824
-Your Majesty…
-She is Empress of Great Qi after all.

34:30.185 --> 34:31.905
Whether she accepts it or not,

34:31.985 --> 34:34.705
this Phoenix Seal belongs to her.

34:34.784 --> 34:35.824
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:50.705 --> 34:51.824
Cangcang…

34:53.025 --> 34:54.505
I let you go.

34:55.585 --> 34:57.225
May you one day truly be free.

35:18.225 --> 35:19.425
Speak. What is it?

35:22.585 --> 35:24.905
His Majesty ordered me
to bring you the Phoenix Seal

35:24.985 --> 35:26.625
and say you will always be
Empress of Great Qi.

35:27.745 --> 35:29.185
Have you ever seen an empress
who walked away from the palace?

35:46.705 --> 35:48.465
PURE AND SPOTLESS

36:04.425 --> 36:06.545
Your Majesty, it's time for your medicine.

36:07.465 --> 36:08.305
Leave it there for now.

36:11.105 --> 36:11.945
The situation at the front is complicated.

36:12.985 --> 36:14.225
There's no need to press yourself.

36:14.825 --> 36:16.625
Please take care of your health.

36:18.425 --> 36:20.625
I know what I'm doing. You may go.

36:42.025 --> 36:42.865
Your Majesty.

36:45.985 --> 36:46.825
Is she all right?

36:48.425 --> 36:49.705
The Empress slipped into
the westbound relief army.

36:49.785 --> 36:50.985
She's fine for now.

36:51.825 --> 36:53.665
Once the battle reports
from Jiangzhou arrive,

36:53.745 --> 36:55.225
bring them straight to me.

36:55.305 --> 36:56.145
Yes, Your Majesty.

37:01.985 --> 37:03.585
You let her go,

37:04.105 --> 37:06.265
yet you still can't let her go.

38:18.385 --> 38:20.825
WUYING HALL

38:51.425 --> 38:54.265
WUYING HALL

38:55.785 --> 38:56.625
Your Majesty,

38:56.705 --> 38:59.545
the westbound reinforcements
will reach Jiangzhou tomorrow.

39:00.225 --> 39:03.425
You can finally get a proper sleep.

39:04.465 --> 39:05.345
Hand me the map.

39:05.865 --> 39:06.745
Yes, Your Majesty.

39:25.985 --> 39:29.745
JIANGZHOU

39:33.505 --> 39:34.825
JIANGZHOU

40:12.545 --> 40:13.825
One hard push,

40:13.905 --> 40:16.185
take this city today!

40:50.145 --> 40:52.705
General, the gate won't hold much longer!

41:05.945 --> 41:07.785
JIANGZHOU

42:04.025 --> 42:06.025
General Ling, get back inside the city!

42:06.865 --> 42:08.705
Leave me! Shut the gates, now!

43:30.665 --> 43:34.825
JIANGZHOU
